msgid "Welcome"
msgstr ""

msgid "Right after someone is signed up for reminders."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi {first_name}, this is {org_name}. We'll text you reminders before your court date: {date} at "
"{time}, {place}. Reply 1 to confirm you got this. Reply STOP to opt out."
msgstr ""
"{first_name}，您好！这里是{org_name}。我们会在您出庭前发短信提醒您。出庭时间：{date}{time}，地点：{place}。回复 1 确认您已收到此短信。回复 STOP "
"退订。"

msgid "Heads-up"
msgstr ""

msgid "The first countdown reminder, usually a week before. Explains what is at stake."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{first_name}, your court date is {date} at {time}, {place}. If you miss it, the judge may issue a "
"warrant for your arrest. Reply 1 to confirm, or 2 if you need help."
msgstr "{first_name}，您的出庭时间是{date}{time}，地点：{place}。如果您没有出庭，法官可能会对您签发逮捕令。回复 1 确认；如需帮助，请回复 2。"

msgid "Make a plan"
msgstr ""

msgid "Later countdown reminders, usually 3 days before. Prompts a plan to get there."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{first_name}, your court date is {date} at {time}. Make a plan now: how you'll get there, and time"
" off work or childcare if you need it. Reply 2 if something could stop you from going."
msgstr "{first_name}，您的出庭时间是{date}{time}。请现在就做好安排：怎么去法院；如有需要，提前请假或找人照看孩子。如果有什么情况可能让您无法出庭，请回复 2。"

msgid "Day before"
msgstr ""

msgid "The day before the court date."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reminder: your court date is tomorrow, {date} at {time}, {place}. Please arrive early. Missing "
"court can lead to a warrant. Questions? Call {org_phone}."
msgstr "提醒：您明天要出庭，时间是{date}{time}，地点：{place}。请提前到达。未出庭可能导致法院签发逮捕令。如有疑问，请致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Morning of"
msgstr ""

msgid "The morning of the court date (only if 0 is in the reminder schedule)."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Today: your court date is at {time}, {place}. Please arrive early. If you are running late, call "
"{org_phone}."
msgstr "今天：您需要在{time}出庭，地点：{place}。请提前到达。如果您会迟到，请致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Date changed"
msgstr ""

msgid "When staff change the date or time."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{first_name}, your court date has changed. The new date is {date} at {time}, {place}. Please go on"
" the new date. Reply 1 to confirm."
msgstr "{first_name}，您的出庭日期已更改。新的出庭时间是{date}{time}，地点：{place}。请按新的日期出庭。回复 1 确认。"

msgid "Date canceled"
msgstr ""

msgid "When staff cancel a court date."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{first_name}, your court date on {date} was canceled. You do not need to go to court that day. "
"We'll text you if a new date is set. Questions? Call {org_phone}."
msgstr "{first_name}，您原定于{date}的出庭已取消。您那天不需要去法院。如果确定了新的日期，我们会发短信通知您。如有疑问，请致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Missed court"
msgstr ""

msgid "After staff mark a court date as missed. Encourages a quick call back."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{first_name}, our records show you may have missed court on {date}. It's not too late to fix this."
" Call {org_phone} today and we'll help you get a new date."
msgstr "{first_name}，我们的记录显示，您可能错过了{date}的出庭。现在补救还来得及。请在今天致电{org_phone}，我们会帮助您获得新的出庭日期。"

msgid "Thanks for confirming"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone replies 1 or YES."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Thank you, {first_name}. You're confirmed for {date} at {time}. If anything changes, reply 2 or "
"call {org_phone}."
msgstr "谢谢您，{first_name}。您已确认在{date}{time}出庭。如有任何变化，请回复 2 或致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Help is on the way"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone replies 2 or NO. Also flags the court date for staff."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Thanks for telling us, {first_name}. Someone from {org_name} will contact you soon. You can also "
"call {org_phone}. Please don't skip court without talking to us first."
msgstr "{first_name}，谢谢您告诉我们。{org_name}的工作人员会尽快与您联系。您也可以致电{org_phone}。在与我们沟通之前，请不要缺席出庭。"

msgid "Opted out"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone replies STOP."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You won't get more texts from {org_name}. Reply START to get reminders again. Questions about your"
" case? Call {org_phone}."
msgstr "您将不会再收到{org_name}的短信。回复 START 可重新接收提醒。对您的案件有疑问？请致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Opted back in"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone replies START after opting out."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: SMS reply to START. Keep "STOP" in Latin letters.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You'll get court date reminders from {org_name} again. Reply STOP to opt out."
msgstr "您将重新收到{org_name}的出庭提醒。回复 STOP 退订。"

msgid "Help and info"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone replies HELP or INFO."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{org_name}: court date reminders. Reply 1 to confirm your date, 2 if you need help. Call "
"{org_phone} with questions. Reply STOP to opt out. Msg & data rates may apply."
msgstr "{org_name}：出庭日期提醒。回复 1 确认您的出庭日期，回复 2 寻求帮助。如有疑问，请致电{org_phone}。回复 STOP 退订。可能产生短信和数据流量费用。"

msgid "Didn't understand"
msgstr ""

msgid "When a reply isn't a keyword. Sent at most once a day; staff see the message."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sorry, we couldn't read that. Reply 1 to confirm your court date or 2 if you need help. A staff "
"member will also read your message."
msgstr "抱歉，我们无法识别您的回复。回复 1 确认您的出庭日期；如需帮助，请回复 2。我们的工作人员也会查看您的信息。"

msgid "No upcoming date"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone confirms but has no upcoming court date on file."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Thanks. We don't see an upcoming court date for you. If you think that's wrong, call {org_phone}."
msgstr "谢谢。我们没有查到您近期的出庭日期。如果您认为有误，请致电{org_phone}。"

msgid "Language changed"
msgstr ""

msgid "When someone texts the name of a language, such as ESPAÑOL."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: SMS reply confirming the language switch. Name YOUR
#. language here (for Spanish: "en español"). Keep "STOP".
msgid "OK. We'll text you in English from now on. Reply STOP to opt out."
msgstr "好的。从现在起，我们将用中文给您发短信。回复 STOP 退订。"

